{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Plant Tales",
    "steam_appid": 3693970,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693970/extras/b5b72f882626c5a38371881c7289bab9.avif?t=1755408694\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect different types of plants and sell them in your plant shop. Use the money to expand and improve your rating through variety, decor and stock. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693970/extras/af8387be731c8a24d7f865831ff4a544.avif?t=1755408694\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to your self-serve counter, you don\u2019t need to stand at the till all day. Head deeper into the rainforest to find rarer plants, and eventually - different biomes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693970/extras/b42ce45e9f5dbf4b1db8a2e91deed81e.avif?t=1755408694\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plants grow quickly, and with a bit of patience they\u2019ll start to multiply on their own! Experiment with propagation in your backyard - eventually you may find rare variegated species and breed new flower colours.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693970/extras/63743313cc204ab62adc2d6a0c5d96d5.avif?t=1755408694\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild clay can be found in the creeks, use it to craft plant pots at the pottery studio! Higher quality pots help your plants sell for more (and look great on display of course).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693970/extras/9a3546805f9f5e1e866e575d649f2eab.avif?t=1755408694\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no better way to display your collection - help the Caretaker restore the community gardens to its former glory. He may even lend you his greenhouse if you do a good job!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693970/extras/b5b72f882626c5a38371881c7289bab9.avif?t=1755408694\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect different types of plants and sell them in your plant shop. Use the money to expand and improve your rating through variety, decor and stock. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693970/extras/af8387be731c8a24d7f865831ff4a544.avif?t=1755408694\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to your self-serve counter, you don\u2019t need to stand at the till all day. Head deeper into the rainforest to find rarer plants, and eventually - different biomes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693970/extras/b42ce45e9f5dbf4b1db8a2e91deed81e.avif?t=1755408694\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plants grow quickly, and with a bit of patience they\u2019ll start to multiply on their own! Experiment with propagation in your backyard - eventually you may find rare variegated species and breed new flower colours.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693970/extras/63743313cc204ab62adc2d6a0c5d96d5.avif?t=1755408694\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wild clay can be found in the creeks, use it to craft plant pots at the pottery studio! Higher quality pots help your plants sell for more (and look great on display of course).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693970/extras/9a3546805f9f5e1e866e575d649f2eab.avif?t=1755408694\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no better way to display your collection - help the Caretaker restore the community gardens to its former glory. He may even lend you his greenhouse if you do a good job!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Plant Tales is a casual farming sim where you collect different types of plants and sell them in your plant shop! Use the money to upgrade your gear, expand your shop, and explore further into the wilderness.",
